#text("For R08, 4,592,399 inherited + 5,848,718 newly collected = 10,441,117 raw lines. The native log counts only the new allocation; wc -l counts the complete saved file. Both are correct and have different scopes. The inherited prefix has the same SHA-256 as R06's original file. The final file is 919,799,315 bytes, SHA-256 62106d7ae9e828ff433d019ba471cf743552b608421e889cd83f6af0296f20b0.")

#text("The native request was 41,407,601 additional relations, corresponding to a configured total of 46,000,000 after the inherited file. That is the tool's collection request. It is not a verified matrix threshold or a percentage-complete denominator. The native ETA is not admitted as a factoring completion estimate.")

