#text("One R08 allocation was planned, attempted and completed; none was excluded. The frozen ")#link("https://github.com/isogeny-labs/crypto/blob/ba09a5e482f0a8faa7fac0ec76c1ed5ce029c4b2/research/nist_skipped_curve_dissection_20261021/factorization/rounds/R08-20261025/PROTOCOL.md")[#text("R08 protocol")]#text(" and ")#link("https://github.com/isogeny-labs/crypto/blob/ba09a5e482f0a8faa7fac0ec76c1ed5ce029c4b2/research/nist_skipped_curve_dissection_20261021/factorization/rounds/R08-20261025/evidence/command.txt")[#text("actual command")]#text(" bind the input, seed 20261022, two workers, native 7200-second budget, outer 7260 seconds plus 30-second kill grace, 4 GiB virtual memory per process and 1 GiB per output file. The native sieve began at 05:52:08 UTC and reported its limit after 7229.9807 seconds while outstanding worker work stopped. The supervisor returned exit 0; the outer process timeout did not fire. This is a normal budget stop, not factoring completion.")

#text("This was an L0 shared local host. UTC timestamps and native elapsed output are provenance, not comparative timing evidence. Runtime source was blob-checked against commit 5cb553810e5bbfbd8691ec614ffcaacefc625757. Patched YAFU SHA-256 is bc7680adbdd7450a68120e73ef8aa88d0336c8ffa141343f50966c595ca6bae9; the earlier binary-bound timeout controls remain applicable.")

#text("The post-run native verifier and a fresh replay on October 26 confirm the whole target, exact product and retained prime certificates. A partial partition is not a complete prime factorization. Existing Lean partition identities remain unchanged; no new algebraic identity is claimed. The ")#link("https://github.com/isogeny-labs/crypto/blob/ba09a5e482f0a8faa7fac0ec76c1ed5ce029c4b2/research/nist_skipped_curve_dissection_20261021/factorization/rounds/R08-20261025/factordb-20261026/cofactor.json")[#text("October 26 FactorDB response")]#text(" still lists C with no proper split.")

#text("Small logs, receipts, certificates, checksums and the result are committed. The ")#link("https://github.com/isogeny-labs/crypto/blob/ba09a5e482f0a8faa7fac0ec76c1ed5ce029c4b2/research/nist_skipped_curve_dissection_20261021/factorization/rounds/R08-20261025/archive-manifest.json")[#text("bulk manifest")]#text(" identifies the full local archive; its remote publication is blocked by the existing ")#link("https://github.com/isogeny-labs/crypto/blob/ba09a5e482f0a8faa7fac0ec76c1ed5ce029c4b2/problems/nist-factorization-raw-archive-publication.md")[#text("artifact-access problem")]#text(". No remote object or successful upload is asserted. A second-runner review of this completion record has not been performed.")

